wn。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/tasks.md:18:- [ ] 3.2 在 Wiki 插件画布中新增任务控制动作（pause/resume/stop）与运行态展示（进度、阶段、错误）。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/tasks.md:25:- [ ] 4.1 扩展 `plugin-ui-canvas-hook` 协议，支持任务控制动作定义与文档会话区块定义。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/tasks.md:26:- [ ] 4.2 在 `plugin-workbench-shell` 实现统一任务状态条与控制按钮，按协议驱动而非 Wiki 插件特判。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/specs/plugin-workbench-shell/spec.md:42:- **THEN** 系统 SHALL 调用对应插件任务的 `pause` 控制命令\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:157:  stopGeneration: (conversationId: string) => Promise<void>\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:300:  stopAgent: (sessionId: string) => Promise<void>\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:308:  stopTask: (input: StopTaskInput) => Promise<void>\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:528:  stopGeneration: (conversationId: string) => {\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:719:  stopAgent: (sessionId: string) => {\napps/electron/src/preload/index.ts:728:  stopTask: (input: StopTaskInput) => {\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/specs/plugin-document-chat-bridge/spec.md:4:系统 SHALL 提供插件文档会话桥接接口，使插件可在指定 `knowledgeBaseId` 上发起多轮问答并绑定会话上下文。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/specs/plugin-document-chat-bridge/spec.md:7:- **WHEN** Wiki 插件以 `pluginId`、`knowledgeBaseId`、`model`、`messages` 发起聊天请求\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/specs/plugin-document-chat-bridge/spec.md:20:系统 MUST 按 `pluginId + knowledgeBaseId + sessionId` 隔离上下文，禁止跨插件或跨知识库串话。\nopenspec/changes/plugin-wiki-deepwiki-capabilities/specs/plugin-document-chat-bridge/spec.md:23:- **WHEN** 两个插件分别在不同 `knowledgeBaseId` 上发起问答\napps/electron/src/main/ipc.ts:89:import { sendMessage, stopGeneration, generateTitle } from './lib/chat-service'\napps/electron/src/main/ipc.ts:109:import { runAgent, stopAgent, generateAgentTitle, saveFilesToAgentSession, copyFolderToSession } from './lib/agent-service'\napps/electron/src/main/ipc